.IX Title "SLMTHREAD 1"
.TH SLMTHREAD 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
slmthread \- threads the language model
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBslmthread\fR \fIprimitive_slm\fR \fIthreaded_slm\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBslmthread\fR add back-off-state for each slm node in the \fIprimitive_slm\fR. 
Also it compresses 32\-bit float into 16 bit representation. These processing 
speeds up the looking up.
.PP
The \fIprimitive_slm\fR is always generated by \fBslmprune\fR. And 
the \fIthreaded_slm\fR can be used to feed \fBslmseg\fR as a reference to segment 
Chinese text.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Originally written by Phill.Zhang <phill.zhang@sun.com>.
Currently maintained by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBslmprune\fR(1), \fBslmseg\fR(1).
